lor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-11T19:01:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T12:15:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.8.dev5.official [9552dfb68]\nv4.7.2.stable.flathub [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 44\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Import Theme Items tool does not import the base type for custom variations.\n\n<img width=\"1048\" height=\"585\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/090fd6d4-6b0c-4ddf-90ca-503a9374bc0a\" />\n\n`PanelContainerButtonGroup` in the screenshot is a variation with a `PanelContainer` base type. However the base type is not available for import so it gets lost in the new theme. This can prevent those styles from being correctly resolved.\n\nIn practice this is an issue for me since I use the tool to import the editor theme items for use in the standalone version of my [kanban plugin](https://github.com/HolonProduction/godot_kanban_tasks). Loosing the base types means I'm having different styling in-editor and standalone.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- Try to import the item from `with_variation.tres` into `no_variation.tres`\n- Notice that nothing gets imported\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[variation_base_type.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32127886/variation_base_type.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123429/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}